[{"title":"季贞风流","author":"郭之奇","text":"四明号狂客，紫宫遇谪仙。\n解龟得酒后，骑马似乘船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35640,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"六年刚载震，频夜梦维蛇。\n及兹诞阿子，居然弄瓦儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35641,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"我怀本无恶，虽女遣余思。\n云何坠地刻，即我断肠期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35642,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"不信颜比玉，翻成命如丝。\n灯前挥泪睫，促对可怜姿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35643,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"谓汝非我女，胡然十月私。\n谓汝为我女，不暂一朝随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35644,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"汝母生邻死，沉痛时未知。\n祇今怀空席，悽怆泣枕欹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35645,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿子歌　十首 其六","author":"郭之奇","text":"对此安能已，强颜作慰词。\n更无词可慰，祇有泪相吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","